abstract: >-
  Code, protocol and results for a study of how much of the response to an AKT inhibitor wider molecular data explains beyond PTEN status in GDSC cancer cell lines, with a measured feature-selection leak and checks of cluster and explanation stability. Work in progress; not peer reviewed.
